  "title": "Artem Taradash",
  "text_sample": "Artem Taradash Close From the very beginning, we\u2019ve been shaping the world through movement, decisions, and attention. The world responds, rearranges itself, and becomes different. At some point, this process stops being accidental. Understanding appears. Responsibility appears. This is where design begins to matter. Most of my work has been about innovation \u2014 not loud or performative, but precise. The kind that comes from a clear understanding of what is missing, what is misaligned, and what should exist but doesn\u2019t yet. To me, design is not a profession and not a set of tools. It is a way of thinking, a way of structuring reality, and a way of making decisions that shape products, brands, and human behavior over time. I work with products and brands as systems \u2014 defining their logic, boundaries, \u200d Artem Taradash About Linkedin Email Taradash Artem About Linkedin Email Everything around us is love. Design is how it takes shape From the very beginning, we\u2019ve been shaping the world through movement, decisions, and attention. The world responds, rearranges itself, and becomes different. At some point, this process stops being accidental. Understanding appears. Responsibility appears.",
